d><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>24</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, for <math><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;the system has infinite solutions&nbsp;",
